@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260712-2hcq1g - Stable History Page and Detail

actor "App or bot actor" as User
participant "ActorContext" as Auth
participant "History service" as History
database "Media + transmissions + targets" as Data
database "Cursor state" as Cursor

User -> Auth : current bearer / verified Telegram identity
Auth --> History : actor, orbit, role, slot, capabilities
User -> History : list(view, limit, cursor?)
History -> Cursor : validate actor + authorization scope + filter
History -> Data : rows <= frozen upper key
Data --> History : retained candidates
History -> History : enforce current source/exact binding visibility
History -> History : derive counts, states, actions, redaction
History -> Cursor : store digest + next boundary (if more)
History --> User : ordered items + opaque next_cursor

User -> History : detail(hi_...)
History -> Data : same authorization projection
History --> User : aggregate + permitted exact targets\nor uniform 404

note bottom
  Newer inserts cannot shift later pages. Wrong actor,
  changed scope/filter, malformed or expired cursor fails closed.
end note

@enduml
